/ActualText (We will have on-site safety and first aid services - provided by Odyssey Medical. This first-rate safety company has provided us with support for many years, and they have been highly reviewed by our past runners. We hope they will have a very quiet weekend, however, they will be on-site with multiple paramedics available, for our entire event.)
